[#61 – #68] Ragdoll Body & Infinite Death Loop Fix




User: Ragdoll wasn't feeling like real physics—upper and lower torso need to move separately with joint limits, arms need full 3D rotation without sinking into the body, and the "felled in battle" screen was looping infinitely.


